# Copy this file to .env and fill in real values.
# .env is gitignored — NEVER commit real credentials.
#
# Purged 2026-09-16. This file previously documented retail supplier and
# payment configuration — Stripe live keys, Williams Trading API credentials,
# Eldorado CIPP FTP host/user/password, and BigCommerce store hash, access
# token and webhook secret. None of that belongs in the clinical repository
# under QP-POL-002, and a public repo made it a supplier-list disclosure.
#
# The retail configuration now lives with the retail codebase. If any value
# listed above was ever real, rotate it in the vendor dashboard — removing a
# credential from a file does not invalidate it.
#
# ── Intake portal ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Preferred: the secure intake URL used for the production booking link.
# Falls back to the TherapyNotes portal in scripts/verify-env.mjs if unset.
VITE_SECURE_INTAKE_URL="https://www.therapyportal.com/p/queercharts/"

# Legacy alias, still honoured by scripts/verify-env.mjs if set.
VITE_JANE_APP_INTAKE_URL=""
